    "`enabledToolSlugs` is the complete set to enable; every other tool of the server is disabled. An\nenabled tool is added to your team's catalog at its latest discovered version, and a disabled one is\nremoved from it. Repeating the same set changes nothing.\n\nBefore changing anything, each tool being enabled, re-enabled, or moved to a newer discovered\nversion is verified against the live server: it must still be listed there, with the same input\nschema as when it was discovered. If any check fails or the server cannot be reached, the request\nfails with 400 and nothing changes; resync and try again. An unknown tool slug is also rejected with\n400. A request that needs verification counts against the resync rate limit (429). Returns the\nserver's full tool list.",
