              "Optional exact-name filter (case-insensitive). Returns the single live (non-terminal) session that currently holds this name for the caller's team, or an empty list if none does. Matches the live holder only, so historical terminal rows and reused names never make it ambiguous (per-team live-name uniqueness bounds it to at most one). This is how clients (doctl / Console) resolve a session name to its id; the {session_id} path stays UUID-only.",
            schema: { type: 'string', example: 'demo-agent' },
