  summary: 'Pause a MicroVM',
  description:
    "To pause a MicroVM, send a POST request to `/v2/microvms/{microvm_id}/pause`.\n\nPausing suspends the MicroVM's processes and preserves its memory, files, and processes.\nA paused MicroVM incurs storage charges only. The request returns when the change\ncompletes. Pausing a MicroVM that is already paused succeeds. The request returns HTTP 400\nwhen the MicroVM is `creating`, `terminated`, or `failed`.\n",
